Page: Probe success establishes decodability; computational use requires additional evidence. ^§10.1
# src §10.3: "A transformer is trained only on sequences of moves in the game Othello. It is not given an explicit board-state representation. Nevertheless, researchers find an internal representation of the evolving board, and interventions on that representation can alter later move predictions (K. Li et al., 2023)."
You: The paper's controlled example is Othello-GPT: a transformer trained only on sequences of moves in the game, never given a board. Researchers find an internal representation of the evolving board, and interventions on that representation can alter later move predictions. ^para
