# ------------------------------------------------------------ Chapter 6 (paper §11, §12, §13)

@chapter 6 What to Ask
@transition dissolve 1200
@bg rooftop dawn
@tone dawn
A roof, and the hour before the lights go out. The examination is over in the sense that nobody is left to call. I put the cup on the parapet.
@show Vector center
Vector: You came about something larger than me. I could tell. Nobody brings a document that long for one column of numbers.
# src §12: "Broader intelligence raises an additional problem: a difference that was safely ignored in one setting may determine success in another."
Page: Broader intelligence raises an additional problem: a difference that was safely ignored in one setting may determine success in another. ^§12
# src §12.1: "A system that sorts cups by color may later be asked which will hold water. It must now use information about cracks."
Page: A system that sorts cups by color may later be asked which will hold water. It must now use information about cracks. ^§12.1
# src §12.1: "If that information is already represented, adapting may require changing the downstream procedure. If it was discarded, the system must acquire it through new observation or learning. These are different routes to broader competence."
Page: If that information is already represented, adapting may require changing the downstream procedure. If it was discarded, the system must acquire it through new observation or learning. These are different routes to broader competence. ^§12.1
